# Showcase repo, whitelist: only what is listed here is published; new files are excluded by default.
# Public: README + media, and the rigid-cup robot pipeline with its setup files.
# Private (stays local): the discrete-shell cup model (discrete_shell/), the flex experiments,
# third_party/ (fetched by fetch_panda.sh), and all generated videos, logs and XML.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!media/
!media/*.gif
!media/*.png
!requirements.txt
!fetch_panda.sh
!cube_drop.py
!cup_rigid.py
!cup_rigid_cube.py
!cup_rigid_cube_airdrop.py
!panda_cup_rigid.py
